<header role="banner">
<div class="container">
<div class="logo" aria-label="Seal Fix home">
<svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/logo.svg#logo"/></svg>
<img src="assets/logo.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden">
<span>Seal Fix</span>
</div>
<nav role="navigation" aria-label="Primary">
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#process">Process</a>
<a href="#contact" class="cta">Get a Quote</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-copy">
<span class="hero-tag rv">Waterproofing & Tiling</span>
<h1 id="hero-title" class="rv">Seal Fix</h1>
<p class="hero-lead rv">Licensed Waterproofing Specialist — commercial, residential and remedial waterproofing with tiling integration.</p>
<a href="#contact" class="hero-cta rv">Request a Quote</a>
</div>
<div class="hero-canvas rv" aria-hidden="true">
<canvas id="hero-canvas"></canvas>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="services" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
<div class="container">
<h2 id="services-title" class="rv">What We Do</h2>
<div class="service-grid">
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
<h3>Waterproofing</h3>
<p>Internal and external wet-area waterproofing to AS 3740. Bathrooms, balconies, planters, podiums and basements.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 3v18"/></svg>
<h3>Tiling</h3>
<p>Floor and wall tiling integrated with waterproofing systems. Large format, mosaic, natural stone and porcelain.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
<h3>Remedial Works</h3>
<p>Leak diagnosis, membrane failure rectification, failed tile remediation and substrate preparation.</p>
</article>
<article class="service-card rv">
<svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
<h3>Commercial Projects</h3>
<p>Multi-unit, retail, hospitality and civil infrastructure waterproofing with project management coordination.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="process" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
<div class="container">
<h2 id="process-title" class="rv">How We Work</h2>
<div class="process-steps">
<article class="step rv">
<h3>Assess</h3>
<p>Site inspection, moisture testing and substrate analysis to determine the correct system for your conditions.</p>
</article>
<article class="step rv">
<h3>Specify</h3>
<p>Select certified membranes, bond-breakers, sealants and tile adhesives matched to the substrate and exposure class.</p>
</article>
<article class="step rv">
<h3>Install</h3>
<p>Qualified application with documented stages — priming, membrane laps, fillets, flood testing and tiling to tolerance.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="lb-rb" aria-label="Recent work and services"><div class="lb-rb__track"><div class="lb-rb__slide is-on" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0b0c10 0%,#e51924 165%)"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:6%;color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(19px,3.4vw,46px);letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.05">Seal Fix</span></div><div class="lb-rb__slide" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0b0c10 0%,#e51924 165%)"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:6%;color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(19px,3.4vw,46px);letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.05">Servicing your area</span></div><div class="lb-rb__slide" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0b0c10 0%,#e51924 165%)"><span style="position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:6%;color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(19px,3.4vw,46px);letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.05">Free quotes &mdash; call today</span></div><button class="lb-rb__nav lb-rb__nav--prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous">&#8249;</button><button class="lb-rb__nav lb-rb__nav--next" type="button" aria-label="Next">&#8250;</button><div class="lb-rb__dots"><button type="button" class="is-on" aria-label="Slide 1"></button><button type="button" class="" aria-label="Slide 2"></button><button type="button" class="" aria-label="Slide 3"></button></div><div class="lb-rb__cap">Seal Fix &mdash; recent work</div></div></section><footer role="contentinfo" id="contact">
